$AI_BIZ_SOURCE/                 (the framework root — read-only, shared by every consumer)
├── skills/  standards/  concepts/  docs/  scripts/  templates/
└── START_HERE.md  CONVENTIONS.md  skills/SKILL_DEPENDENCIES.md
```

